2026-08-16T11:33:46Z    [HAS:Pre-exceptional operating profit] GATE critic: Wrong fiscal period basis: the forecast for FY2026 (full-year) was derived from an H1 2025 figure (25.5) and H1-based growth rates, including a mixed-period “FY2024→H1 2025” growth of -75.7%. The correct comparator for FY2026 should be FY2025 full-year pre-exceptional operating profit and a full-year YoY growth rate. Using H1 2025 (25.5) as the prior-year same period and mixing FY and H1 growths invalidates the -0.2565 GBPm estimate.
