2026-08-16T11:34:20Z    [ADI:Adjusted gross margin] GATE critic: You’ve double‑counted FY2025 Q3. For a FY2026 Q3 forecast, the “last 4 reported” quarters are FY2025 Q3–Q4 and FY2026 Q1–Q2, so your prior‑year same period (FY2025 Q3 = 69.2%) is already included in the 70.85% “last 4” mean. Averaging FY2025 Q3 again with that mean (to get 70.025%) overweights that one quarter and biases the result downward before the +0.5 pp tilt.
